            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Sensory capacity of pulpo-dentinal complex depends on the site, different density and functional diversity of nerve fibers in the dental pulp. In the dentin and dental pulp only the pain is provoked regardless of the kind of irritant. But the pain can be expressed by several forms of appearance.</AbstractText>
